# Trim component 1, glued to the plate along its bottom face (SET1 1 of the
# trim part); 1 mm gap tolerance for the incongruent interface
TrimComponentCoupling;1;1
TrimCouplingTolerances;1;SolidGlued;0.1;0.001
[model;TrimComponent;1]
# Master frequencies of the trim
FreqLinearSteps1;2;50.;50.;9
# A melamine-like foam: skeleton (MAT1), air (MAT10) and the Biot
# parameters (MATPE1); the porous solids have FCTN = PORO
IsoMat;11;1.6E+5;;0.44;8.8;;;0.1
FluidMat;12;;1.21;343.
PoroElasticMat;10;11;12;;;;1.84E-5;1.402;0.71;0.99;1.02;1.E+4;1.E-4;2.E-4
SolidProp;10;10;;;;;Poroelastic
